     xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/">
    <owl:Ontology rdf:about="https://ontoboard.org/patterns/pmdco-process-temporal-dimensions.owl">
        <dcterms:description rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Specifies the temporal extent and the temporal boundaries of a process on the time axis. The annealing example gives the process an occupied temporal interval with explicit first and last instants, and names the participants (furnace, ingot).</dcterms:description>
        <dcterms:license rdf:resource="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"/>
        <dcterms:title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Temporal dimensions of a process</dcterms:title>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Curated by OntoBoard 1.155.0, so that the pattern passes ODK&apos;s quality report with its default profile, names every term with a label, and is consistent and coherent. Changes: label moved to skos:prefLabel x1; label added x8; term declared x4;
- header: dcterms:title &quot;Temporal dimensions of a process&quot; - the library&apos;s name for the pattern
- header: dcterms:description - the library&apos;s description of the pattern
- header: dcterms:license &lt;https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/&gt; - https://github.com/materialdigital/core-ontology
Each change is listed under &quot;curated&quot; in the pattern&apos;s metadata.json in OntoBoard&apos;s pattern library.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Ontology>
    


